Be sure the work turns your crank.

00:23:14.810 --> 00:23:20.000
Don't go to the job for an extra $10 or
$15 or whatever that number is.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.490
Go to the job 'cuz the work turns your
crank.

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:25.200
It really turns you on.

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:26.370
Excites you every day.

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:29.020
That's what you gotta work for.

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:31.240
You can't go to one because, it's, well,
it's

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:33.445
a job but now as I look for another one.

