00:24:33.512 --> 00:24:36.940
You wanna be in a family friendly,
friendly company that's for sure.

00:24:38.780 --> 00:24:44.500
But I do think the, the work life bad
balancing is not in a company brochure.

00:24:44.500 --> 00:24:45.490
That's a recruiting tool.

00:24:46.490 --> 00:24:49.960
What it really is, is an old-fashioned
chit system.

00:24:49.960 --> 00:24:53.390
You over deliver, you make your boss look
good.

00:24:53.390 --> 00:24:55.090
You put chips in the bag.

00:24:55.090 --> 00:24:59.420
When you need flexibility, whether it be
for ballet or whether it be for yoga or

00:24:59.420 --> 00:25:04.380
whether it be for a kid that, whatever it
is, you pull the chips back out.

00:25:04.380 --> 00:25:06.500
But it is a old fashioned chip system.

00:25:08.770 --> 00:25:12.480
And those that asize and those that
deliver get to earn flexibility.

00:25:12.480 --> 00:25:14.350
And it's something that is clearly earned.

00:25:15.400 --> 00:25:19.730
And it's not something that is handed to
you at the beginning of a game.

00:25:19.730 --> 00:25:23.668
We, we tell this story in the book of this
job where

00:25:23.668 --> 00:25:28.380
a friend, a friend of ours was running a
small operation, 60 people.

00:25:28.380 --> 00:25:31.070
One of the women in the job had a second
