00:25:41.590 --> 00:25:42.630
Is that okay?

00:25:42.630 --> 00:25:45.218
And they said, absolutely you're doing a
great job.

00:25:45.218 --> 00:25:48.850
You're doing it fine and then they're,
they're gonna do it.

00:25:48.850 --> 00:25:54.580
Immediately, down the hall prances this
young man 6 months out of

00:25:54.580 --> 00:25:59.750
school, and he says, I'd like to get
Friday off and Monday off.

00:26:00.990 --> 00:26:03.410
And, the boss said, why?

00:26:04.720 --> 00:26:07.280
He said I wanna practice, perfect my yoga
practice.

00:26:08.590 --> 00:26:12.250
And the boss, she, she said, no.

00:26:12.250 --> 00:26:13.450
No way.

00:26:13.450 --> 00:26:15.080
And he said, you mean to say you're

00:26:15.080 --> 00:26:17.320
making a judgement, and you're, you're not
qualified, I'll

00:26:17.320 --> 00:26:19.490
tell you that right now, to make a
judgement

00:26:19.490 --> 00:26:24.190
between motherhood is more valuable than
my yoga practice.

00:26:24.190 --> 00:26:26.410
You have no right to do that.

00:26:26.410 --> 00:26:29.130
And she said I'm not making that
judgement.

00:26:29.130 --> 00:26:33.240
I'm making the judgement that you haven't
earned a thing in the 6 months you've

00:26:33.240 --> 00:26:35.120
been here, therefore, you don't get the

00:26:35.120 --> 00:26:38.810
flexibility, you're barely doing your job
now [LAUGH].

00:26:38.810 --> 00:26:41.400
So, that's the way it's always going to
be.

00:26:41.400 --> 00:26:44.920
It's, you deliver, you get flexibility.

00:26:44.920 --> 00:26:49.930
You, if every time your boss has a report,
or needs something, desperately wants to

00:26:49.930 --> 00:26:56.560
get it and you say, I can't be there,
things aren't gonna go right for you.

00:26:56.560 --> 00:26:58.350
You've gotta find your systems that allow

00:26:58.350 --> 00:27:01.060
you to overdeliver, and then earn
flexibility.

00:27:02.600 --> 00:27:06.650
&gt;&gt; Jack, obviously, you've learned about
