00:48:19.579 --> 00:48:25.310
being able to work, immediate performers,
not being able to work, work together.

00:48:25.310 --> 00:48:29.728
If you set the behaviors you want, if you
say cut throat

00:48:29.728 --> 00:48:34.929
behavior, no sharing of ideas is, is a
