00:48:37.040 --> 00:48:38.350
You get, you won't get it.

00:48:38.350 --> 00:48:42.420
If you don't allow it in you culture,
you'll get it.

00:48:42.420 --> 00:48:44.530
Let's get back to values.

00:48:44.530 --> 00:48:47.660
You set the values and the behaviors.

00:48:47.660 --> 00:48:48.846
But now, let me let you finish your
