00:49:01.790 --> 00:49:03.260
&gt;&gt; All of your own people.

00:49:03.260 --> 00:49:04.750
&gt;&gt; You mean ten people, and you don't
know?

00:49:04.750 --> 00:49:07.030
I mean, that's your job.

00:49:09.520 --> 00:49:12.660
I mean, that is fundamentally the job you
